dsh-api-key-pool README · Copy into your DSH profile's plugins directory：mkdir -p ~/.dsh/profiles/web/plugins/dsh-api-key-pool
cp -r lib package.json cordis.patch.yml ~/.dsh/profiles/web/plugins/dsh-api-key-pool/
```

Then declare the bundle in `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`:

```json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        {
          "name": "dsh-api-key-pool",
          "platform": ["web"],
          "optional": false
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Restart DSH:

```bash
npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web
```

